WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.646
- This is a moving marketplace.

00:00:01.646 --> 00:00:06.143
I am actually thinking about 
buying drive time radio ads

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:07.854
for the first time in 10 years

00:00:07.854 --> 00:00:10.256
because the price 
has gone down so much

00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:12.856
that I'm now curious 
if the ROI is there.

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:14.985
I'm not a digitalist 
or a futurist.

00:00:14.985 --> 00:00:16.681
I don't give a shit about technology.

00:00:16.681 --> 00:00:18.845
I care about your attention.

00:00:18.845 --> 00:00:20.180
Because if I have 
your attention,

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:21.984
if I'm good enough 
after that point,

00:00:21.984 --> 00:00:24.096
I can sell you something.

00:00:24.096 --> 00:00:25.105
It's not confusing.

00:00:25.105 --> 00:00:26.485
It's not complicated.

00:00:26.485 --> 00:00:28.926
The problem is it's hard work.

00:00:28.926 --> 00:00:31.167
(upbeat music)

